k zayn the irish han  solo of borderlands  of course that's only one man's thoughts  who is the right vault hunter for you  i'd really love to know i'll be looking  in the comments to see who you guys  prefer and more importantly  why you chose that vault hunter  hopefully this video was helpful thank  you very much for your time it's been a  pleasure  i'm adam from playstation grenade i'll  see you next time  good

